{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core gameplay of Evocation differs from other card games. Your deck is distributed across the six nodes of the magic circle, and you take turns by drawing formations through connecting these nodes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075830/extras/6d49a85d3a6c29c0564ee1f03cd87e43.poster.avif?t=1764862153\" width=812 height=842 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075830/extras/6d49a85d3a6c29c0564ee1f03cd87e43.webm?t=1764862153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075830/extras/6d49a85d3a6c29c0564ee1f03cd87e43.mp4?t=1764862153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a descendant of King Solomon, you are not only skilled in performing rituals but can also command demons. Performing rituals grants you energy, which allows you to summon powerful demons in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075830/extras/658eca29a7a169f8a5ea73d3a7194463.poster.avif?t=1764862153\" width=1170 height=914 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075830/extras/658eca29a7a169f8a5ea73d3a7194463.webm?t=1764862153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075830/extras/658eca29a7a169f8a5ea73d3a7194463.mp4?t=1764862153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After defeating a boss enemy, you can offer him/her as a sacrifice to a demon, allowing that demon to be summoned without consuming energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have reimagined the relic system commonly found in similar games and evolved it into an equipment-unguent system. Unlike relics, equipment can be freely equipped, sold, and enhanced with unguents to grant additional effects.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075830/extras/b32780215ee8577e04107040b4d2969c.poster.avif?t=1764862153\" width=1170 height=538 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075830/extras/b32780215ee8577e04107040b4d2969c.webm?t=1764862153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075830/extras/b32780215ee8577e04107040b4d2969c.mp4?t=1764862153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The single-player mode of Evocation  includes 3 initial decks and corresponding card pools, over 300 cards, and 40 unique enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, we are not content with just a single-player mode. The core gameplay of Evocation  is perfectly suited for a online PvP card game. In PvP mode, both players share the magic circle, with each player's deck distributed across the three nodes closest to them. You and your opponent can use each other's cards for rituals. This means that homogeneous matchups will not exist in\u00a0Evocation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The PvP mode will not include any in-app purchases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether in single-player or online modes, we have invested significant effort into design and balance. We hope you can enjoy the game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4075830?t=1764862153","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4075830?t=1764862153","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075830/3e688176d53cca7aff5cc1ae197d35c8a3c0c57a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764862153","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075830/3e688176d53cca7aff5cc1ae197d35c8a3c0c57a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764862153","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4199210,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core gameplay of Evocation differs from other card games. Your deck is distributed across the six nodes of the magic circle, and you take turns by drawing formations through connecting these nodes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075830/extras/6d49a85d3a6c29c0564ee1f03cd87e43.poster.avif?t=1764862153\" width=812 height=842 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075830/extras/6d49a85d3a6c29c0564ee1f03cd87e43.webm?t=1764862153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075830/extras/6d49a85d3a6c29c0564ee1f03cd87e43.mp4?t=1764862153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a descendant of King Solomon, you are not only skilled in performing rituals but can also command demons. Performing rituals grants you energy, which allows you to summon powerful demons in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075830/extras/658eca29a7a169f8a5ea73d3a7194463.poster.avif?t=1764862153\" width=1170 height=914 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075830/extras/658eca29a7a169f8a5ea73d3a7194463.webm?t=1764862153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075830/extras/658eca29a7a169f8a5ea73d3a7194463.mp4?t=1764862153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After defeating a boss enemy, you can offer him/her as a sacrifice to a demon, allowing that demon to be summoned without consuming energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have reimagined the relic system commonly found in similar games and evolved it into an equipment-unguent system. Unlike relics, equipment can be freely equipped, sold, and enhanced with unguents to grant additional effects.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075830/extras/b32780215ee8577e04107040b4d2969c.poster.avif?t=1764862153\" width=1170 height=538 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075830/extras/b32780215ee8577e04107040b4d2969c.webm?t=1764862153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075830/extras/b32780215ee8577e04107040b4d2969c.mp4?t=1764862153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The single-player mode of Evocation  includes 3 initial decks and corresponding card pools, over 300 cards, and 40 unique enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, we are not content with just a single-player mode. The core gameplay of Evocation  is perfectly suited for a online PvP card game. In PvP mode, both players share the magic circle, with each player's deck distributed across the three nodes closest to them. You and your opponent can use each other's cards for rituals. This means that homogeneous matchups will not exist in\u00a0Evocation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The PvP mode will not include any in-app purchases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether in single-player or online modes, we have invested significant effort into design and balance. We hope you can enjoy the game.</p>","developers":["vodkakaa"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075830/509a49ff1fe3f49707b110eb714ff888f3970c4f/header.jpg?t=1764862153","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OSX 10.14+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  1Gb Video Memory, capable of OpenGL 3.0+ support (2.1 with ARB extensions acceptable)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4075830/1282931469/3705c9098fe2c7df01577f451a23d46547fc882e/1762857890/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762860412","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4075830/1282931469/3705c9098fe2c7df01577f451a23d46547fc882e/1762857890/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762860412","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4075830/1282931469/3705c9098fe2c7df01577f451a23d46547fc882e/1762857890/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762860412","id":257226118,"name":"english","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.s