ractivity, and deep mechanics. It includes a roguelike PvE mode and an online PvP mode without in-app purchases. Draw and maintain your magical circle, freely trade and craft equipment, and purge the heretics along the pilgrimage path.","steam_appid":4075830,"support_info":{"email":"602908228@qq.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, French, Russian, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Spanish - Spain<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}